{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19545","headline":"夜闻洛滨吹笙 · 张仲素","name":"夜闻洛滨吹笙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王子千年後，笙音五夜闻。\n逶迤绕清洛，断续下仙云。\n泄泄飘难定，啾啾曲未分。\n松风助幽律，波月动轻文。\n凤管听何远，鸾声若在羣。\n暗空思羽盖，余气自氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}